{
  "id": "programming_practice_tools__referencias__fuentes_utilizadas",
  "title": "Referencias",
  "pages": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Referencias del contenido desarrollado"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Cerf, V. G. (1969). ASCII format for network interchange (RFC 20). RFC Editor. https://doi.org/10.17487/RFC20",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "ASCII format for network interchange",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Git. (2026, 28 de septiembre). gitattributes: Defining attributes per path (versión 2.56.0). https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes/2.56.0",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "gitattributes: Defining attributes per path",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "ISO/IEC JTC 1/SC 22/WG 21. (2023). Working draft, standard for programming language C++ (N4950). https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg21/docs/papers/2023/n4950.pdf"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Kernighan, B. W., & Pike, R. (1999). The practice of programming. Addison-Wesley."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Kitware. (2026). CMake reference documentation (versión 4.3). https://cmake.org/cmake/help/v4.3/",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "CMake reference documentation",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2021, 3 de agosto). Once pragma. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/preprocessor/once?view=msvc-170",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Once pragma",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2022, 26 de octubre). File translation constants. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/c-runtime-library/file-translation-constants?view=msvc-170",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "File translation constants",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2023, 3 de febrero). Where. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/administration/windows-commands/where",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Where",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2024, 13 de junio). Data type ranges. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/cpp/data-type-ranges?view=msvc-170",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Data type ranges",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2025a, 23 de mayo). Cmd. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/administration/windows-commands/cmd",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Cmd",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2025b, 29 de septiembre). about_Quoting_Rules. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/microsoft.powershell.core/about/about_quoting_rules?view=powershell-5.1",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "about_Quoting_Rules",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Scott, C. (2025). Professional CMake: A practical guide (21.ª ed.). https://crascit.com/professional-cmake/"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Thomas, D., & Hunt, A. (2020). The pragmatic programmer: Your journey to mastery (2.ª ed.). Addison-Wesley Professional."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
